Subject: [PATCH] feat: load the font files addons ship on first use

FontString:SetFont with a font file an addon ships
(Interface\AddOns\<Addon>\...) used the default font, as only Blizzard's
font paths were known. Load such a file from the AddOns directories on
first use, resolved ignoring case like the client's file lookup, with the
weight, style and stretch of its face, so a bold file of a family renders
bold. A missing file warns once and keeps the default font; what the
client does then is not documented.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
